{"seq":2,"slug":"prospect-theory","title":"前景理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/behavioral-finance/foundations/prospect-theory","wordCount":1892,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"前景理论\">前景理论</h1><p>1979 年，丹尼尔·卡尼曼（Daniel Kahneman）和阿莫斯·特沃斯基（Amos Tversky）在《计量经济学》上发表了一篇标题平淡的论文《前景理论：风险下的决策分析》，它后来成为社会科学被引用次数最多的论文之一，并在 2002 年为卡尼曼赢得诺贝尔经济学奖（特沃斯基已于 1996 年去世）。这篇论文做的事很激进：它没有去修补理性选择理论的边角，而是用真实的人在赌局前到底怎么选，重写了「人如何对待风险」的整套数学。前景理论是整个行为金融学的形式化内核——后面讲到的损失厌恶、处置效应、心理账户，全都从它生长出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>标准经济学用期望效用理论描述风险决策：人最大化各结果效用的概率加权和，而效用是建立在最终财富水平上的。前景理论指出，真实的人在三个地方系统性地背离这套理论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[期望效用理论] --&gt; B[效用基于最终财富水平]&#10;    A --&gt; C[概率线性加权]&#10;    A --&gt; D[风险态度处处一致]&#10;    E[前景理论] --&gt; F[价值基于相对参照点的得失]&#10;    E --&gt; G[概率被非线性扭曲]&#10;    E --&gt; H[得失域风险态度相反]&#10;    F --&gt; I[损失厌恶&lt;br/&gt;损失比等额收益更痛]&#10;    G --&gt; J[小概率被高估&lt;br/&gt;大概率被低估]&#10;    H --&gt; K[收益域风险厌恶&lt;br/&gt;损失域风险偏好]\">flowchart TD\n    A[期望效用理论] --&gt; B[效用基于最终财富水平]\n    A --&gt; C[概率线性加权]\n    A --&gt; D[风险态度处处一致]\n    E[前景理论] --&gt; F[价值基于相对参照点的得失]\n    E --&gt; G[概率被非线性扭曲]\n    E --&gt; H[得失域风险态度相反]\n    F --&gt; I[损失厌恶&lt;br/&gt;损失比等额收益更痛]\n    G --&gt; J[小概率被高估&lt;br/&gt;大概率被低估]\n    H --&gt; K[收益域风险厌恶&lt;br/&gt;损失域风险偏好]</pre><p>前景理论把决策拆成两个阶段。先是编辑阶段：人把选项简化、编码为相对某个参照点的得与失。再是评估阶段：人用一个价值函数和一个概率权重函数来给每个前景打分。背离理性的根源就藏在这两个函数的形状里。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>期望效用理论</th>\n<th>前景理论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评价对象</td>\n<td>最终财富的绝对水平</td>\n<td>相对参照点的变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数形状</td>\n<td>整体凹（风险厌恶）</td>\n<td>S 形，拐点在参照点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>损失与收益</td>\n<td>对称处理</td>\n<td>损失斜率约为收益的 2 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率处理</td>\n<td>线性（真实概率）</td>\n<td>决策权重，扭曲真实概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型违反</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>阿莱悖论、框架效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价值函数-参照点与-s-形曲线\">价值函数：参照点与 S 形曲线</h2><p>前景理论的价值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不是定义在财富水平上，而是定义在相对参照点的变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 上。卡尼曼和特沃斯基给出的经典函数形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>β</mi></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x) = \\begin{cases} x^{\\alpha} &amp; x \\geq 0 \\\\ -\\lambda (-x)^{\\beta} &amp; x &lt; 0 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中实验估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx \\beta \\approx 0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>，损失厌恶系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span>。这三个参数刻画了三个深刻的人性事实。</p>\n<p>第一，参照点依赖：同样拥有 100 万，从 50 万涨上来的人和从 200 万跌下来的人感受截然不同，因为价值定义在变化而非水平上。第二，敏感度递减：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha, \\beta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 让函数在两个方向都是凹/凸的，从赚 100 到赚 200 的喜悦，远大于从赚 1100 到赚 1200。第三，损失厌恶：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着丢掉 100 元的痛苦，大约需要赢得 225 元的快乐才能抵消。</p>\n<p>损失厌恶是这条曲线最有力的部分。它直接解释了<a href=\"../biases/overconfidence-disposition\">过度自信与处置效应</a>里投资者「卖盈守亏」的行为——卖出亏损股等于承认损失、把痛苦实现，而人本能地推迟这种痛苦。它也是<a href=\"emh-challenges\">有效市场假说与挑战</a>提到的股权溢价之谜的主流行为解释：人对股票短期波动的损失格外敏感，因而要求过高的风险补偿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概率权重-为什么我们买彩票又买保险\">概率权重：为什么我们买彩票又买保险</h2><p>期望效用理论假设人用真实概率加权。前景理论用一个权重函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 替代真实概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，它呈倒 S 形：在低概率区间高估（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(p) &gt; p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>），在中高概率区间低估（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(p) &lt; p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>γ</mi></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.61</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(p) = \\frac{p^{\\gamma}}{(p^{\\gamma} + (1-p)^{\\gamma})^{1/\\gamma}}, \\quad \\gamma \\approx 0.61</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2954em;vertical-align:-0.954em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3414em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.61</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个倒 S 形一举解释了一个长期让经济学家困惑的矛盾：同一个人为什么既买彩票（爱小概率大收益）又买保险（怕小概率大损失）。在收益域，高估小概率让中头奖的微小机会显得诱人；在损失域，高估小概率让车祸、火灾这类罕见灾难显得可怕到必须投保。两种行为都不是理性概率计算的产物，而是同一个扭曲函数在不同符号域的表现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[小概率被高估] --&gt; B[收益域: 爱赌博]&#10;    A --&gt; C[损失域: 爱投保]&#10;    D[大概率被低估] --&gt; E[收益域: 风险厌恶&lt;br/&gt;宁要确定的小收益]&#10;    D --&gt; F[损失域: 风险偏好&lt;br/&gt;赌一把避免确定损失]&#10;    B --&gt; G[四重风险态度模式]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[小概率被高估] --&gt; B[收益域: 爱赌博]\n    A --&gt; C[损失域: 爱投保]\n    D[大概率被低估] --&gt; E[收益域: 风险厌恶&lt;br/&gt;宁要确定的小收益]\n    D --&gt; F[损失域: 风险偏好&lt;br/&gt;赌一把避免确定损失]\n    B --&gt; G[四重风险态度模式]\n    C --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>价值函数与概率权重叠加，产生著名的「四重风险态度模式」：高概率收益下风险厌恶、高概率损失下风险偏好、低概率收益下风险偏好、低概率损失下风险厌恶。这套模式是预测真实投资行为远比 CAPM 准确的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"框架效应-同一事实的两种讲法\">框架效应：同一事实的两种讲法</h2><p>既然价值定义在相对参照点的得失上，那么改变描述方式、移动参照点，就能让同一个客观选择被做出相反的决定。这就是框架效应，它是前景理论最具颠覆性的推论。</p>\n<p>特沃斯基与卡尼曼的「亚洲疾病问题」是教科书级实验：面对一场预计致死 600 人的疫情，当方案用「拯救 200 人」（收益框架）描述时，多数人选确定方案、表现风险厌恶；当同一方案用「400 人死亡」（损失框架）描述时，多数人转向赌博、表现风险偏好。两组选项在期望意义上完全等价，唯一差别是参照点被语言悄悄移动了。</p>\n<p>框架效应说明理性选择理论的一个隐含公理——描述不变性（同一选择无论怎么描述都应得到同样的决定）——在真人身上系统性失效。这个机制是<a href=\"../biases/mental-accounting-framing\">心理账户与框架</a>整章的理论地基，也是<a href=\"../applications/nudge-defaults\">助推与默认选项</a>能够「不改变选项却改变选择」的科学依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"累积前景理论与现代修正\">累积前景理论与现代修正</h2><p>1992 年卡尼曼和特沃斯基发表了累积前景理论（Cumulative Prospect Theory, CPT），用「秩依赖」的累积权重替代了原版逐个结果加权的方式，解决了原理论可能违反一阶随机占优的技术缺陷，并把模型推广到任意多个结果与连续分布。CPT 至今是行为资产定价、行为博弈论实证拟合的标准工具。</p>\n<p>近年研究还在两个方向上推进。一是参照点的内生化——参照点不只是现状，还可能是期望、目标或社会比较点，这让模型对实际选择的预测力更强。二是与神经经济学结合，功能性磁共振成像（fMRI）研究发现损失在大脑杏仁核和脑岛的激活确实比等额收益更强，为损失厌恶提供了生理证据。这些进展让前景理论从一个描述性模型，逐步成为可以预测和干预的工程工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>前景理论用价值函数与概率权重函数，替代期望效用理论，刻画真人的风险决策。</li>\n<li>价值函数是参照点依赖的 S 形曲线，关键参数为敏感度递减（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta \\approx 0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>）与损失厌恶（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>概率权重呈倒 S 形，高估小概率、低估大概率，统一解释了买彩票与买保险的并存。</li>\n<li>四重风险态度模式比 CAPM 更准确地预测真实投资行为。</li>\n<li>框架效应推翻了描述不变性公理，是心理账户与助推干预的理论地基。</li>\n<li>累积前景理论（1992）修正了一阶随机占优缺陷，成为现代行为资产定价的标准工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前景理论","id":"前景理论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价值函数：参照点与 S 形曲线","id":"价值函数-参照点与-s-形曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"概率权重：为什么我们买彩票又买保险","id":"概率权重-为什么我们买彩票又买保险"},{"level":2,"text":"框架效应：同一事实的两种讲法","id":"框架效应-同一事实的两种讲法"},{"level":2,"text":"累积前景理论与现代修正","id":"累积前景理论与现代修正"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"有效市场假说与挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/behavioral-finance/foundations/emh-challenges"},"next":{"title":"有限理性与启发式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/behavioral-finance/foundations/bounded-rationality"}}